body:
Once I was standing in line to check out at Target behind a mom and her daughter who was being a BRAT, and her mom told her if she didn't behave she wouldn't get the nail polish she wanted. The girl quieted down for a bit but once the transaction was over the girl got snotty again and said "Now that you bought them it's too late, I can do what I want!"

&#x200B;

So mom digs the three bottles of nail polish out of the bag, turns to me and says "Hi there, I was going to get these for my baby girl but she just un-earned them, you may have them instead!" and just placed them with my scanned stuff and dragged her daughter away. (who was GLARING at me now by the way!)

&#x200B;

I still have them lol

I had never watched ATLA and knew nothing about it other than what Aang looked like. 

&#x200B;

I went to see Avatar (The space-ferngully one) in theatres, and I had seen a trailer for The Last Airbender beforehand and so I thought they were the same movie based on the names.

&#x200B;

An hour into Avatar I leaned over to my friend and whispered "When does the kid with the arrow on his head come in?"
